  "description": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE – VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\r\nRAY COOKE Lettings are delighted to present this fantastic 1 bed / 1 bath apartment to the letting market in Mayeston Square, Finglas, Dublin 11.\r\nMayeston Square is ideally located close to a host of local amenities including shops, schools, parks and public transport links, while Dublin City Centre is easily accessible via a number of bus routes. The M50 and N2 are also within easy reach.\r\nThe property comprises an entrance hallway, bright and spacious living room with access to the balcony, fully fitted kitchen, large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and a main bathroom.\r\nThe apartment is presented in good condition throughout and benefits from bright and well-proportioned living accommodation, ample storage and secure parking.\r\nContact Ray Cooke Lettings today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n- 1 bed / 1 bath\r\n- Apartment\r\n- Fantastic condition throughout\r\n- Comes fully furnished\r\n- Top quality windows & doors\r\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\r\n- Top quality flooring\r\n- Very spacious rooms\r\n- Luxurious modern fitted wardrobes\r\n- Top quality blinds\r\n- Secure underground parking\r\n- Overlooking green area\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Integrated appliances\r\n- Low maintenance balcony\r\n- Peaceful location\r\n- Located in the heart of Finglas\r\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\r\n- Bus routes on your doorstep\r\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\r\n- Viewing highly advised\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE",
